{"version": 1, "sourceSha256": "dcd99fdd721d477c241dff65f179402f3d8a9ee1c47995f4523f1f5acec2f6bf", "documents": [{"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}, {"id": "offline-dcd99fdd721d477c241d", "filename": "13-Part C.mp3", "sha256": "dcd99fdd721d477c241dff65f179402f3d8a9ee1c47995f4523f1f5acec2f6bf", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-5/dcd99fdd721d477c241dff65f179402f3d8a9ee1c47995f4523f1f5acec2f6bf.mp3", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/dcd99fdd721d477c241dff65f179402f3d8a9ee1c47995f4523f1f5acec2f6bf.json", "format": "mp3", "role": "recording"}], "units": [{"id": "jahshan-1BAqtB9Q77sU-nKu-R7doE75tAHSYjhqm-C-0", "label": "Jahshan set 13 · Part C", "part": "C", "sourceSha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "pages": [157, 158], "questions": [{"number": 31, "prompt": "What began Henry's special interest in macular degeneration?\nA seeing the impact it had on his own family\nB treating many patients over a 30-year career\nC observing the isolation that comes from the disease", "sourcePage": 157, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "B", "page": 160, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 32, "prompt": "In Henry's opinion, what is the most troubling aspect of the disease?\nA the inability to recognise the faces of loved ones\nB the psychological impact it can often generate\nC the changes it causes to a person's daily existence", "sourcePage": 157, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "C", "page": 160, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 33, "prompt": "Henry thinks that the traumas associated with loss of vision are\nA sometimes overlooked within the optometry community.\nB commonly misconceived as part of the aging process.\nC less understood than with many other diseases.", "sourcePage": 157, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "A", "page": 160, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 34, "prompt": "Henry believes macular degeneration patients initially keep their fears to\nthemselves because they\nA are scared to admit they have a serious condition.\nB do not feel completely comfortable discussing their disease.\nC consider their disease minor in comparison to total blindness.", "sourcePage": 157, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "C", "page": 160, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 35, "prompt": "Why did Henry choose his patient called Jennifer to test his new method?\nA because she had a special kind of macular degeneration\nB because of her negative reaction to her condition\nC because her illness was worsening at a fast rate", "sourcePage": 157, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "B", "page": 160, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 36, "prompt": "Henry says that preventing macular degeneration is about\nA checking signs of visual impairment immediately.\nB continuing current research into treatment.\nC beginning with positive changes to one's lifestyle.\n\nPart C.2", "sourcePage": 157, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "A", "page": 160, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 37, "prompt": "Rebecca says that a challenge many healthcare providers face with\noverweight patients is\nA establishing a strong relationship.\nB balancing aspects of communication.\nC timing their discussions effectively.", "sourcePage": 158, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "B", "page": 160, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 38, "prompt": "Rebecca believes that demonstrating sensitivity when discussing weight is\nA established from the outset of the consultation.\nB sometimes misunderstood by healthcare providers.\nC directing language away from the term obesity.", "sourcePage": 158, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "A", "page": 160, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 39, "prompt": "Rebecca suggests that asking open-ended questions\nA helps eliminate any personal prejudice.\nB covers many barriers with a single sentence.\nC is the ideal way to begin the consultation.", "sourcePage": 158, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "B", "page": 160, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 40, "prompt": "When consultations prove difficult, Rebecca suggests\nA focussing on the patient's general health rather than obesity.\nB convincing the patient that support is never out of reach.\nC changing the way the patient views their weight problem.", "sourcePage": 158, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "C", "page": 160, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 41, "prompt": "Rebecca thinks that a patient's continuing education\nA should include of a small number of obtainable objectives.\nB can present new demands for the healthcare provider.\nC must include the family in order to be successful.", "sourcePage": 158, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "A", "page": 160, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 42, "prompt": "According to Rebecca, motivational interviewing is about the healthcare\nprovider\nA utilising well established practices in patient conduct.\nB taking charge of the changes to a patient's behaviour.\nC understanding the patient's individual situation.", "sourcePage": 158, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "C", "page": 160, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}], "skills": ["listening"], "recordings": ["dcd99fdd721d477c241dff65f179402f3d8a9ee1c47995f4523f1f5acec2f6bf"], "answerSources": [], "matchEvidence": "Exact original recording SHA-256 in the verified Jahshan collection"}]}
